      "title": "CORRECT → \"E[g(X)]=∑g(x)P(X=x), using X's PMF/PDF directly. No need to find distribution of g(X).\" → A02",
      "content": "{\"id\":\"TA-5\",\"title\":\"CORRECT → \\\"E[g(X)]=∑g(x)P(X=x), using X's PMF/PDF directly. No need to find distribution of g(X).\\\" → A02\",\"primitives\":[],\"addresses\":[]}",
