    {
      "assetId": "math.prob.law-of-unconscious/teaching_action_meta/TA-11",
      "kind": "teaching_action_meta",
      "conceptId": "math.prob.law-of-unconscious",
      "title": "NO_RESPONSE → \"Directly compute ∫₀^∞ x²·λe^{−λx}dx. Use integration by parts: let u=x², dv=λe^{−λx}dx. Then du=2x dx, v=−e^{−λx}. Result: [−x²e^{−λx}]₀^∞ + ∫₀^∞ 2x·e^{−λx}dx. The first term is 0; the second is (2/λ)E[X]=(2/λ)(1/λ)=2/λ².\" → TB-R02 → Gate",
      "content": "{\"id\":\"TA-11\",\"title\":\"NO_RESPONSE → \\\"Directly compute ∫₀^∞ x²·λe^{−λx}dx. Use integration by parts: let u=x², dv=λe^{−λx}dx. Then du=2x dx, v=−e^{−λx}. Result: [−x²e^{−λx}]₀^∞ + ∫₀^∞ 2x·e^{−λx}dx. The first term is 0; the second is (2/λ)E[X]=(2/λ)(1/λ)=2/λ².\\\" → TB-R02 → Gate\",\"primitives\":[],\"addresses\":[]}",
      "localKey": "TA-11",
      "language": "en",
      "refs": [],
      "span": {
